    "title_ja": "「クロマチン凝縮によるレトロウイルスのヌクレオソーム組み込み制御の分子基盤」の訂正",
    "abstract_ja": "本論文は、以下の論文の訂正である：Delphine Lapaillerie, Yury Zgadzay, Fábio Gouveia Martins, Carole Bertinetti, Michel Autin, Julien Batisse, Camille Tumiotto, Paul Lesbats, Marc Ruff, Sergio Filipe Sousa, Vincent Parissi, Molecular basis for the regulation of retroviral nucleosomal integration by chromatin compaction, Nucleic Acids Research, Volume 54, Issue 13, 22 July 2026, gkag705, https://doi.org/10.1093/nar/gkag705"
